		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>scatteredly, here and
			there</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ἀπώλλυντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.4
				</span></i>
			 (
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σποράδες</span>
			)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">; οἰκεῖν</span>, i.e. not in
			communities, <i><span class="en">
