					Plu.
					2.629e
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ς</span>., opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἐλλόγιμοι Πυθαγορικοί</span>, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				8.91
			</span></i>.</div>
